 "consequence": "Site C reviewed the written protocol and confirmed that Day 30 falls inside the defined Week 4 window, scheduled the visit accordingly, and documented the decision. They also began using a more structured format for recruitment-source and outreach-notes, updating most of their outstanding records, which reduces missing-field flags on the dashboard. No borderline cases required escalation to the sponsor.",
 "world_update": {
