 "resource": "At Site B, a part-time data assistant is temporarily reassigned to another project, leaving the coordinator to handle both visit logistics and EDC entry for the next week. This slows the pace of catching up detailed outreach-notes, even though core visit scheduling and safety assessments remain on track.",
 "actors": "Site C’s team adopts the suggested outreach-notes template and shares informal positive feedback with the sponsor about its usefulness. Site B’s coordinator focuses on keeping upcoming Week 4 visits scheduled inside the clarified window but postpones some narrative outreach documentation until support returns. The sponsor operations lead forwards the new Week 4 clarification and asks regional operations to help ensure all sites interpret the examples consistently."
