 "resource": "Staffing continues to be moderately strained at Site C, making them sensitive to additional documentation requirements; however, their core visit scheduling and safety assessments are being maintained on time. The shared calendar shows Week 8 lab days with generally balanced capacity after earlier rescheduling, and there is still some slack on later days if further small adjustments are needed.",
